    unsafe_capabilities_block_unsupported_in_expression_position_2026-08-30, P3, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "stale: FIXED by p3sweep-20261127 - expression-position unsafe block header without its ': block' now fails fast in HIR lowering with a clear diagnostic; unsafe_capabilities_value_position_spec 7/7 PASS 2026-11-27. Was: `unsafe(capabilities: [...])` is a STATEMENT-only form; in expression position it silently becomes a call and breaks LLVM codegen", doc/08_tracking/bug/unsafe_capabilities_block_unsupported_in_expression_position_2026-08-30.md, 1, doc/08_tracking/bug/unsafe_capabilities_block_unsupported_in_expression_position_2026-08-30.md, 2026-08-30, 2026-11-27, true

