    unsafe_capabilities_block_unsupported_in_expression_position_2026-08-30, 1, "revalidated 2026-11-02 (close-invalid lane): action=fixed_pending_verification NOT confirmed - no merged fix commit or passing regression cited in the bug doc or git history; keep open"
    unsafe_capabilities_block_unsupported_in_expression_position_2026-08-30, 0, "2026-11-27 p3sweep-20261127: two findings. (1) The block form in expression position is ALREADY fixed at this base (comp9 2026-11-11 parse_unsafe_block_expr_if_present, primary_expr.spl:575) - verified val x = unsafe(capabilities: [ffi]): 7 lowers clean. (2) The residual silent-miscompile shape was the block-less header val x = unsafe(capabilities: [ffi]) parsed as a call to identifier unsafe; fixed in src/compiler/20.hir/hir_lowering/_Expressions/expression_core.spl with a private call_args_have_capabilities_name guard in the Call arm (fires only when callee ident unsafe/danger has a capabilities: named arg and resolves in no surface). New diagnostic: unsafe(capabilities: ...) is an unsafe block header without its ': block'. Spec test/01_unit/compiler/hir/unsafe_capabilities_value_position_spec.spl 7/7 PASS on fresh HEAD seed; pinned neighbours unsafe_call_argument_parser 8/8, unsafe_block_expression 5/5, unsafe_block_binding_type 3/3, hir_function_unsafe_caps 4/4, assurance unsafe_capabilities 5/5, scoped_unsafe_function_body 1/1, unsafe_optional_cast 3/3 all PASS. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/compiler/hir/unsafe_capabilities_value_position_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/compiler/hir/unsafe_call_argument_parser_spec.spl"

